  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 306.01 Activities Eligible for a Statutory Permit by Notification (SPN)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 306.01 Activities Eligible for a Statutory Permit by Notification (SPN). A project shall be eligible to submit a notification for a statutory permit-by-notification (SPN) if:\n\n(a) The project qualifies under Env-Wt 308.04; and\n\n(b) All applicable requirements and conditions are met.\n\nSource. #12803, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt300.html"
